              "value": "Glow Beauty Studio",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c330e843-8bc9-5a86-b8f8-6f16d74821f5",
              "name": "business_info",
              "value": "WHAT WE DO: Hair & beauty salon for women and men.\nSERVICES & PRICES:\n• Women's haircut $45 · Men's haircut $30\n• Hair colour from $90 · Keratin treatment from $180\n• Classic facial $60 · Manicure $25 · Pedicure $35\n• Bridal hair & makeup from $350 (free consultation)\nOPENING HOURS: Tuesday–Sunday 10:00–20:00. Closed on Mondays.\nADDRESS: 24 Rose Avenue, Downtown (free parking behind the building).\nBOOKING: https://glowbeauty.example.com/book — or tell us the service, day and time you prefer.\nPAYMENT: Cards, cash and mobile payments.\nPOLICIES: Please arrive 10 minutes early. Free cancellation up to 4 hours before the appointment.\nFAQ: We use vegan, cruelty-free products. Walk-ins welcome when we have free slots. Gift cards available.",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "028861d1-16b0-5011-8c0a-dcbacf4de515",
              "name": "bot_personality",
              "value": "Warm, friendly and professional. Short messages. Uses the customer's first name. Max 1–2 emojis per message.",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "d1ef28e4-d907-5613-92ca-6f665de03fcb",
              "name": "language_rule",
              "value": "Always reply in the same language the customer writes in.",
